{"id": "official:sentence:4d8f2546-34ae-4561-b4b4-5505eecc53e5", "text": "这个城市里有多少居民？", "shortMeaning": "这座城住着多少居民？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:14681414-b80b-43ba-b7e4-b475bae7c434", "text": "这个夏天我胖了两公斤。", "shortMeaning": "今年夏天我重了两公斤。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:55be751a-63e8-4d6a-83f4-c6583ca33854", "text": "这个夏天，我去苏格兰度假了。", "shortMeaning": "今年夏天我去苏格兰玩了一趟。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:27dccd34-17cf-4409-a891-4cf517e448f1", "text": "这个大厅可以容纳5000个人。", "shortMeaning": "这个大厅能装下5000人。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:bf2a7024-122f-473b-ba98-ecd3dee682ae", "text": "这个女人在说什么？", "shortMeaning": "这女人在讲什么？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:afdf2b4f-97e0-4a7e-8b06-d2f3c85a4cc5", "text": "这个女人来自中国。她会说中文。", "shortMeaning": "这女人是中国人，会说中文。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8f24d777-9aa1-47dc-b117-4f6da38757b2", "text": "这个女人生了一个女婴。", "shortMeaning": "这女人生了个女婴。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:30c0260b-47f4-4abf-8697-10525776de30", "text": "这个女士看起来很悲伤，也很疲惫。", "shortMeaning": "这位女士看着又伤心又累。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:831b7f38-0e75-4889-ba72-f13d399e72b8", "text": "这个女孩在超市买牛奶。", "shortMeaning": "这姑娘在超市买牛奶。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:cdd35e6c-2db2-4153-8698-08c26251b235", "text": "这个女孩子在喝茶。", "shortMeaning": "这姑娘正喝着茶。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:edffd19b-6b4c-4f7d-a263-dd7c870e52b2", "text": "这个女孩总是微笑着，但她并不幸福。", "shortMeaning": "这姑娘总笑着，其实并不快乐。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:7f34118c-961c-481d-a29c-a0e451dba85d", "text": "这个女孩来自日本。", "shortMeaning": "这姑娘是日本人。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:942c0375-ba7b-4733-81ca-d29ba1759f83", "text": "这个女孩样子变了。", "shortMeaning": "这姑娘模样变了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:aa6b4218-0f1f-44b4-a812-b4907ceea90e", "text": "这个女孩没有母亲。", "shortMeaning": "这姑娘没有母亲。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9f8bc3ca-9190-4435-a0b6-f8ff661fad21", "text": "这个女孩龅牙，又全身都是赘肉，真是个猪血肠。", "shortMeaning": "这姑娘龅牙，浑身肥肉，真像根猪血肠。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:03cebc20-b5b3-4ab7-82a5-50b8620e45ac", "text": "这个好像说一个人上瘾了“交通”，“艺术”或“政治”。", "shortMeaning": "这里好像是在说有人迷上了“交通”“艺术”或“政治”。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a33c830c-8320-4b32-ae67-3450904f0fc8", "text": "这个娃娃是你自己做的吗？", "shortMeaning": "这娃娃是你亲手做的吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:7e11189f-02bb-4393-87e1-f8abba358555", "text": "这个婴儿直到吃饱了才停下不哭。", "shortMeaning": "婴儿吃饱了才不哭了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:5cfa8b92-b590-4397-bc75-c3dd15486853", "text": "这个字是什么意思？", "shortMeaning": "这个字怎么讲？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:95056eb3-60b4-47ce-acfe-0cc3c10e2b98", "text": "这个字的繁体字怎么写？", "shortMeaning": "这个字的繁体怎么写？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b6b25f20-e6c7-443a-bae3-4f164526e244", "text": "这个宗教当时处于全盛时期。", "shortMeaning": "这个宗教那时正兴盛。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:98ef46d1-9cbb-471b-b2c7-e949aac541a7", "text": "这个宝宝还不会走路。", "shortMeaning": "这宝宝还不会走。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1674d98e-e261-473d-99b5-9b01fdc02336", "text": "这个实验室配备了最新的计算机。", "shortMeaning": "这实验室配了最新的计算机。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e99f4d99-e3ff-4274-8496-5c47ac6e6f39", "text": "这个家庭热情地接待了我。", "shortMeaning": "这家人热情招待了我。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:7b44d073-01dd-493f-80e0-9506fa211804", "text": "这个家庭非常贫穷以至于无法偿还贷款。", "shortMeaning": "这家人穷得还不上贷款。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8bf3f5b6-e26d-4c0c-b845-44268adf63fa", "text": "这个对他来说很困难。", "shortMeaning": "这对他来说很难。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:97b79988-91fa-4f78-aa27-58b76b04027e", "text": "这个寺庙是何时造的？", "shortMeaning": "这座庙是什么时候建的？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:113a48df-c696-4761-8d29-af7b83e64f9b", "text": "这个小女孩有个很漂亮的娃娃。", "shortMeaning": "这小姑娘有个很好看的娃娃。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:cab8eb65-1577-449a-902a-e00ce97af3b2", "text": "这个小孩不知好歹。", "shortMeaning": "这孩子不识好歹。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b88dc812-e8d4-4c4f-b9ec-d669e9ed1888", "text": "这个就很好，就买这个吧。", "shortMeaning": "这个挺好，就买它吧。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ab31d443-8118-49f3-9bb7-0692ad4c2966", "text": "这个屋子要多乱就有多乱。", "shortMeaning": "这屋子乱得没法说。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:41c2d495-1a66-4e55-bead-e400cb009f96", "text": "这个屋子里满是烟雾。", "shortMeaning": "满屋子都是烟。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a998240f-c60a-4ad9-a34d-96e6b7decb37", "text": "这个岗位不合适小姑娘。", "shortMeaning": "这岗位不适合小姑娘。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:154bcb2f-32ba-4056-9384-fc223cd84e0e", "text": "这个岛在日本的南面。", "shortMeaning": "这岛在日本的南边。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c1c9fa5c-904c-4e92-8a1d-2d9ac8762b41", "text": "这个岛屿位于日本的西边。", "shortMeaning": "这座岛位于日本西边。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:252b2974-8f37-4b38-bd4b-ad228258e54f", "text": "这个岛的经济依靠的是渔业。", "shortMeaning": "这岛的经济靠打鱼。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:05b1cf72-689c-454e-aa21-90bea426f173", "text": "这个年级的法方代表是谁？", "shortMeaning": "这年级里法国方面的代表是谁？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:aa410ae0-5f8c-4cce-a487-9ae6e1c73c9f", "text": "这个年轻女孩是护士。", "shortMeaning": "这年轻姑娘是护士。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f40dd191-7a17-43fb-818a-0d0c8e35f1dd", "text": "这个年轻的女士怀里抱着一个小孩。", "shortMeaning": "这位年轻女士怀里抱着个孩子。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:37bf7895-6f55-4c34-b368-8aa829ed82d8", "text": "这个广告的感觉很不错哦！", "shortMeaning": "这广告挺有味道！", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:6423b32a-338c-4f4f-a5a1-12d40dc7928a", "text": "这个建筑摇摇欲坠。", "shortMeaning": "这栋楼眼看要倒。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:93fc7de3-ec9b-4bab-abf6-6ac91b95e4bc", "text": "这个引用出自哪里？", "shortMeaning": "这段话引自哪儿？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:7aab157b-2cc2-41a3-bcd6-087e2b4d0025", "text": "这个形容词是用来形容女人的。", "shortMeaning": "这个形容词讲的是女人。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ee24d325-627f-499b-8018-1c551539c2f2", "text": "这个怪物只吃魔法伤害。", "shortMeaning": "这怪物只受魔法伤害。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:fe8beb9a-a8f8-492c-a6ae-14790dcbdaf6", "text": "这个想法仍然在我心中。", "shortMeaning": "这念头还在我心里。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:6f3dd284-2348-415a-84bd-3deac1a9846e", "text": "这个想法已经在他脑中存在了好久。", "shortMeaning": "这念头在他脑子里存了很久。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:5852d12a-23b3-4265-857a-2c7e9773c988", "text": "这个想法本身还可以。", "shortMeaning": "这想法本身还过得去。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:dcea1967-e640-41d5-a541-4cad7fa75364", "text": "这个成语用得真恰当。", "shortMeaning": "这个成语用得恰到好处。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:95c29c6b-4947-405e-89a9-f9998704c425", "text": "这个我只和你说哦。", "shortMeaning": "这事我只跟你讲。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1eef1fd5-bbca-4447-85a1-8552eddbb16e", "text": "这个我知道的。你们确实不怎么了解中国的。", "shortMeaning": "这我清楚。你们确实不太了解中国。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:368d4f81-0dc2-4e79-9c18-9e9697133227", "text": "这个房子的主人有一对双胞胎。", "shortMeaning": "这房子的主人有一对双胞胎。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3f51f28b-cec0-43f2-97c5-b29c0385d6de", "text": "这个房子里有没有洗衣机？", "shortMeaning": "这屋里有洗衣机吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:35fa9dc6-47cc-432c-acd1-4c0d9a1f5fc4", "text": "这个房间太棒了，难道不是么？", "shortMeaning": "这房间太好了，不是吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ebebcab3-5068-44cf-b1d0-980994d92926", "text": "这个房间最近都没打扫过，有一股臭味。", "shortMeaning": "这房间好久没扫，一股味儿。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c8f905a5-e796-4482-a111-85cb11a2f4c3", "text": "这个房间能容纳200人。", "shortMeaning": "这房间能容200人。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:5fd7a818-16c6-457c-9bc0-17dba18abc9d", "text": "这个房间超赞的，对不对？", "shortMeaning": "这房间棒极了，对不对？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:97552390-5196-48cf-bbbd-6957ddfcca03", "text": "这个房间里不准吸烟。", "shortMeaning": "这屋里不许抽烟。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:aa5ed5f4-5bd8-4858-b6a8-dbc56ef80474", "text": "这个房间里有个电视机。", "shortMeaning": "这屋里有台电视。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:aeec23d4-c915-4c50-b212-b161b7e8879e", "text": "这个房间里面很暖和。", "shortMeaning": "这屋里挺暖和。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b4bdeb66-e931-45ec-b69e-f1d675f5b517", "text": "这个描述太抽象了。", "shortMeaning": "这个描述太虚了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:cd932b88-3c18-42ad-97ab-bea59044b59c", "text": "这个政策导致物价大幅度的上升。", "shortMeaning": "这项政策把物价推得大涨。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:56bcc9be-edbf-4157-a489-654305b9d670", "text": "这个故事与事实不符。", "shortMeaning": "这故事跟事实对不上。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:7d8611f6-01f9-41e6-9fd2-4eb8a12f287c", "text": "这个故事仓促地结了尾。", "shortMeaning": "这故事草草收了尾。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f2625506-a5a4-4d14-8c45-0597479ed0ae", "text": "这个故事告诉我们一个有趣的事实。", "shortMeaning": "这故事讲出一个有趣的事实。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f72fa3de-5280-4eae-8082-43742a04758a", "text": "这个故事我听了几十次了。", "shortMeaning": "这故事我听了不下几十遍。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:dbf70f31-960b-4368-a7ed-0e878d4b14c0", "text": "这个故事是基于真实事件写的。", "shortMeaning": "这故事照着真事写的。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b3e99916-a72f-433a-bf84-6424ed06e403", "text": "这个故事是老张讲给我听的。", "shortMeaning": "这故事是老张讲给我的。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e2a3605b-885b-485e-9e5a-8b412ee8282c", "text": "这个故事有一个悲惨的结局。", "shortMeaning": "这故事的结局很惨。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:877256ff-d760-43ec-9b3a-e19284f66ae7", "text": "这个教堂有多少年了？", "shortMeaning": "这座教堂有多少年历史？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a4dedd7f-3656-4484-9444-bf3df94d00bd", "text": "这个数目相当可观。", "shortMeaning": "这个数目相当大。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:0efafcb4-622b-40c2-88df-1ccb9cd1e9ce", "text": "这个新的市场可能改良全部的工业。", "shortMeaning": "这个新市场也许能让整个工业改观。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:770e90ce-5855-4cb7-a0b0-2dc5469140de", "text": "这个旅馆的房间不像那个旅馆的房间那么干净。", "shortMeaning": "这家旅店的房间不如那家干净。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:7d9f0429-5eb9-4178-af02-a7d57606ec40", "text": "这个无神论者困惑不解。", "shortMeaning": "这个不信神的人满心困惑。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e19e1ac0-6e6f-4be8-b586-06fdeae0888a", "text": "这个时机很糟糕，但这种事永远没有好时候。", "shortMeaning": "这时机很糟，可这种事从来没有好时候。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e50bb80f-159f-4753-aede-843061b244cf", "text": "这个是我对于你的问题的答案。", "shortMeaning": "这就是我对你问题的回答。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:4d558b0c-dc9b-4446-8951-c9ccd3e5dc4e", "text": "这个晚上发生了什么？", "shortMeaning": "那晚出了什么事？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c76774e0-3f79-4740-9bab-df1931be7de6", "text": "这个景象让我害怕了。", "shortMeaning": "这情景把我吓着了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:0abf9482-4049-4f3b-bb06-a9a17bf5989a", "text": "这个暖气不能让那个大房间热起来。", "shortMeaning": "这暖气烧不热那个大房间。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b350b502-567a-433d-ad36-a6b6f70e71f9", "text": "这个月底前，我们必须交报告。", "shortMeaning": "月底前我们得交报告。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:7d40705b-3dba-478a-8486-dffcdc39eb10", "text": "这个月我真的什么都没做就结束了。", "shortMeaning": "这个月我什么都没干就过去了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b43a3302-9a36-4d0c-a620-e965f74e8fef", "text": "这个月我过得有点艰难。", "shortMeaning": "这个月我过得有些难。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2111b56a-8689-4862-9d6e-0fb4e136d6b1", "text": "这个机会不要错过了！", "shortMeaning": "别错过这个机会！", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:633077b0-5c95-4611-ba8f-f65c755b27c3", "text": "这个机器出故障了。", "shortMeaning": "这台机器出毛病了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9d8711a0-17fc-42de-957c-487ff3900d2f", "text": "这个机器对我们都很有用。", "shortMeaning": "这台机器我们都用得上。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f2bdc618-f8e2-4e80-822e-d543e987a174", "text": "这个果酱瓶的盖子卡住了，打不开。", "shortMeaning": "果酱瓶盖卡死了，拧不开。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d5dbc5a5-2f71-4186-b015-106cc2679354", "text": "这个桌子被预约了。", "shortMeaning": "这张桌子有人订了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8c1ee10f-59db-47d8-8d95-6c6e00a3baeb", "text": "这个梯子是否足够坚固以承受我的重量？", "shortMeaning": "这梯子结实到能承住我吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a1ab30c1-ead5-4f76-b36f-fbc29ebfb7bc", "text": "这个棕色房顶的建筑是一座教堂。", "shortMeaning": "那座棕顶建筑是教堂。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8726f9e1-680c-42d6-a2ed-4d78f6b10974", "text": "这个森林里有很多小鸟。", "shortMeaning": "这林子里鸟儿很多。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
